[
    {
        "content": "<p>Going over the <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib-overview.html\">mathlib library overview</a>, I find a number of mathematical concepts or results I'd consider important that are missing from that list. For example:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>the Freyd-Mitchell embedding theorem <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=FreydMitchell.embedding#doc\">docs#FreydMitchell.embedding</a>,</li>\n<li>cusp forms (<a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=CuspForm#doc\">docs#CuspForm</a>) and modular forms (<a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=ModularForm#doc\">docs#ModularForm</a>),</li>\n<li>covariant derivatives (<a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=CovariantDerivative#doc\">docs#CovariantDerivative</a>; PRed in <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/pull/38072\">#38072</a>),</li>\n<li>spectral sequences,</li>\n<li>simplicial homology,</li>\n<li>singular homology,</li>\n<li>Fernique's theorem,</li>\n<li>the Central limit theorem,</li>\n<li>simplicial complexes (<a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=SimplicialComplex#doc\">docs#SimplicialComplex</a> and <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=AbstractSimplicialComplex#doc\">docs#AbstractSimplicialComplex</a>),</li>\n</ul>\n<p>and I am surely missing more! You can help by suggesting other standard topics I'm missing, or making a PR adding these to <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/blob/master/docs/overview.yaml\">the overview file</a>.</p>",
        "id": 585666755,
        "sender_full_name": "Michael Rothgang",
        "timestamp": 1776260875
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Yesterday I suggested using the treemap visualizer to find more gaps in the overview: <a class=\"message-link\" href=\"/#narrow/channel/113488-general/topic/program.20visualizer.20by.20Jonathan.20Blow/near/585427413\">#general &gt; program visualizer by Jonathan Blow @ 💬</a> <br>\nIf someone wants to pick that up, I would greatly appreciate that!</p>",
        "id": 585673208,
        "sender_full_name": "Johan Commelin",
        "timestamp": 1776262316
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Probably someof the theorems in <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/1000.html\">https://leanprover-community.github.io/1000.html</a> should also be in the overview</p>",
        "id": 585730504,
        "sender_full_name": "Riccardo Brasca",
        "timestamp": 1776277522
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Here is a Python script that generates <a href=\"/user_uploads/3121/ZN0WNzX2I4Xsgc6_gqVDjmvg/mathlib_overview_treemap.json\">mathlib_overview_treemap.json</a> (1.2MB) which you can upload to <a href=\"https://lean-experiment.vercel.app/mathlib.html\">https://lean-experiment.vercel.app/mathlib.html</a> in the DATA field.</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"ch\">#!/usr/bin/env python3</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">\"\"\"</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">Generate treemap data for Mathlib overview coverage visualization.</span>\n\n<span class=\"sd\">Downloads overview.yaml and declaration-data.bmp (JSON), then produces</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">a treemap JSON file for https://lean-experiment.vercel.app/mathlib.html</span>\n\n<span class=\"sd\">- Area: number of declarations per file</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">- Color: number of overview.yaml items per file</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">\"\"\"</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">json</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">yaml</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">requests</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">OVERVIEW_URL</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/master/docs/overview.yaml\"</span>\n<span class=\"n\">DECL_DATA_URL</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/declarations/declaration-data.bmp\"</span>\n<span class=\"n\">OUTPUT_PATH</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"mathlib_overview_treemap.json\"</span>\n\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">extract_declarations</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">obj</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"sd\">\"\"\"Recursively extract all declaration name strings from the YAML structure.\"\"\"</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">decls</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"p\">[]</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"nb\">isinstance</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">obj</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"nb\">dict</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">value</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"n\">obj</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">values</span><span class=\"p\">():</span>\n            <span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"nb\">isinstance</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">value</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"nb\">str</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n                <span class=\"n\">decls</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">append</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">value</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"k\">else</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n                <span class=\"n\">decls</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">extend</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">extract_declarations</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">value</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">elif</span> <span class=\"nb\">isinstance</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">obj</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"nb\">list</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">item</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"n\">obj</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">decls</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">extend</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">extract_declarations</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">item</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">decls</span>\n\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">doclink_to_filepath</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">doclink</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"sd\">\"\"\"Convert './Mathlib/Foo/Bar.html#Name' to 'Mathlib/Foo/Bar.lean'.\"\"\"</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">path</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">doclink</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">split</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">\"#\"</span><span class=\"p\">)[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">]</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"n\">path</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">startswith</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">\"./\"</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">path</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">path</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">:]</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"n\">path</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">endswith</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">\".html\"</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">path</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">path</span><span class=\"p\">[:</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"o\">+</span> <span class=\"s2\">\".lean\"</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">path</span>\n\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">():</span>\n    <span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">\"Fetching overview.yaml...\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">resp</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">requests</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">get</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">OVERVIEW_URL</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">resp</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">raise_for_status</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">overview_decls</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">extract_declarations</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">yaml</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">safe_load</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">resp</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">text</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n    <span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"sa\">f</span><span class=\"s2\">\"  </span><span class=\"si\">{</span><span class=\"nb\">len</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">overview_decls</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"si\">}</span><span class=\"s2\"> declarations\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n    <span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">\"Fetching declaration-data.bmp (~63MB)...\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">resp</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">requests</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">get</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">DECL_DATA_URL</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">resp</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">raise_for_status</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">decl_map</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">json</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">loads</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">resp</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">text</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">get</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">\"declarations\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"p\">{})</span>\n    <span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"sa\">f</span><span class=\"s2\">\"  </span><span class=\"si\">{</span><span class=\"nb\">len</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">decl_map</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"si\">}</span><span class=\"s2\"> declarations\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n    <span class=\"c1\"># Count all declarations per file</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">file_decl_count</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"p\">{}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">info</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"n\">decl_map</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">values</span><span class=\"p\">():</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">fp</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">doclink_to_filepath</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">info</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s2\">\"docLink\"</span><span class=\"p\">])</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">file_decl_count</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">fp</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">file_decl_count</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">get</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">fp</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"o\">+</span> <span class=\"mi\">1</span>\n\n    <span class=\"c1\"># Count overview declarations per file</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">file_overview_count</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"p\">{}</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">not_found</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"p\">[]</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">decl</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"n\">overview_decls</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"n\">decl</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"n\">decl_map</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">fp</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">doclink_to_filepath</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">decl_map</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">decl</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"s2\">\"docLink\"</span><span class=\"p\">])</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">file_overview_count</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">fp</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">file_overview_count</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">get</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">fp</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"o\">+</span> <span class=\"mi\">1</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">else</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">not_found</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">append</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">decl</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n    <span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"n\">not_found</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"sa\">f</span><span class=\"s2\">\"  </span><span class=\"si\">{</span><span class=\"nb\">len</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">not_found</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"si\">}</span><span class=\"s2\"> overview items not found in docs: </span><span class=\"si\">{</span><span class=\"n\">not_found</span><span class=\"p\">[:</span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"si\">}</span><span class=\"s2\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n    <span class=\"c1\"># Build entries</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">entries</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"p\">[]</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">filepath</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"nb\">sorted</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">file_decl_count</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">entries</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">append</span><span class=\"p\">({</span>\n            <span class=\"s2\">\"path\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">filepath</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"s2\">\"series\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span>\n                <span class=\"s2\">\"decl_count\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">file_decl_count</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">filepath</span><span class=\"p\">],</span>\n                <span class=\"s2\">\"overview_count\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">file_overview_count</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">get</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">filepath</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">),</span>\n            <span class=\"p\">}</span>\n        <span class=\"p\">})</span>\n\n    <span class=\"k\">with</span> <span class=\"nb\">open</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">OUTPUT_PATH</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"w\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"k\">as</span> <span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">json</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">dump</span><span class=\"p\">({</span><span class=\"s2\">\"entries\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">entries</span><span class=\"p\">},</span> <span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">indent</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n    <span class=\"n\">covered</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"nb\">sum</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span> <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">e</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"n\">entries</span> <span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"n\">e</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s2\">\"series\"</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"s2\">\"overview_count\"</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"o\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"sa\">f</span><span class=\"s2\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s2\">Wrote </span><span class=\"si\">{</span><span class=\"n\">OUTPUT_PATH</span><span class=\"si\">}</span><span class=\"s2\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"sa\">f</span><span class=\"s2\">\"  </span><span class=\"si\">{</span><span class=\"nb\">len</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">entries</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"si\">}</span><span class=\"s2\"> files, </span><span class=\"si\">{</span><span class=\"n\">covered</span><span class=\"si\">}</span><span class=\"s2\"> with overview coverage (</span><span class=\"si\">{</span><span class=\"n\">covered</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"mi\">100</span><span class=\"o\">//</span><span class=\"nb\">len</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">entries</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"si\">}</span><span class=\"s2\">%)\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"__main__\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
        "id": 585852942,
        "sender_full_name": "Johan Commelin",
        "timestamp": 1776332434
    },
    {
